# The 160 per-case fixtures are split out of
# tests/fixtures/_source/conformance.gds by tests/common/gen_fixtures.rs the
# first time a test asks for a fixture path. Directory-scoped and anchored, not
# `*.gds`: the source library and the two hand-authored oracles beside it
# (manifest.json, expectations.json) stay tracked, and nothing regenerates them.
/tests/fixtures/drc/
/tests/fixtures/erc/
/tests/fixtures/lvs/
/tests/fixtures/pex/
